            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ezekiel 28:7",
        "book": "Ezekiel",
        "chapter": 28,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "They shall bring thee down to the pit, and thou shalt die the deaths of them that are slain in the midst of the seas.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 72,
            "end": 85
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ezekiel 28:8",
        "book": "Ezekiel",
        "chapter": 28,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Wilt thou yet say before him that slayeth thee, I am God? but thou shalt be a man, and no God, in the hand of him that slayeth thee.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 50,
            "end": 52
          },
          {
            "start": 67,
            "end": 75
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ezekiel 28:9",
        "book": "Ezekiel",
        "chapter": 28,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou shalt die the deaths of the uncircumcised by the hand of strangers: for I have spoken it, saith the Lord God.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 91,
            "end": 94
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ezekiel 28:10",
        "book": "Ezekiel",
        "chapter": 28,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Moreover the word of the Lord came unto me, saying,",
